---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/?$/, '/');
---
<Layout title="Experience" description="Naman Patel’s experience in SEO, content, web development, and Android software.">
  <div class="quiet-page">
    <header class="quiet-page-header"><h1>Experience</h1><p>I started with search and content. Building the tools I needed pulled me into software.</p></header>
    <div class="experience-list">
      <section>
        <h2>SEO & content</h2><p>Keyword research, search intent, on-page SEO, technical fixes, and content publishing. I use Search Console and analytics to understand what’s working and where to improve.</p><p>I worked on a content project that reached roughly one million monthly visitors at its peak, and a US entertainment project that was later acquired.</p>
        <div class="tool-icons" aria-label="SEO and content tools">
          <span class="tool-brand"><span class="tool-mark tool-mark--search-console" aria-hidden="true"></span><span>Search Console</span></span>
          <span class="tool-brand"><span class="tool-mark tool-mark--wordpress" aria-hidden="true"></span><span>WordPress</span></span>
          <span class="tool-brand"><span class="tool-mark tool-mark--analytics" aria-hidden="true"></span><span>Analytics</span></span>
        </div>
      </section>
      <section>
        <h2>Web development</h2><p>Building responsive websites and browser tools, from the first interface through debugging, deployment, and ongoing maintenance.</p>
        <div class="tool-icons" aria-label="Web development tools">
          <span class="tool-brand"><span class="tool-mark tool-mark--astro" aria-hidden="true"></span><span>Astro</span></span>
          <span class="tool-brand"><span class="tool-mark tool-mark--html" aria-hidden="true"></span><span>HTML</span></span>
          <span class="tool-brand"><span class="tool-mark tool-mark--css" aria-hidden="true"></span><span>CSS</span></span>
          <span class="tool-brand"><span class="tool-mark tool-mark--javascript" aria-hidden="true"></span><span>JavaScript</span></span>
          <span class="tool-brand"><span class="tool-mark tool-mark--github" aria-hidden="true"></span><span>GitHub</span></span>
        </div>
      </section>
      <section>
        <h2>Android & development workflows</h2><p>Building on-device utilities with Kotlin, testing with emulators, and preparing releases. I also use AI coding tools and supervised agent workflows as part of development.</p>
        <div class="tool-icons" aria-label="Android and development tools">
          <span class="tool-brand"><span class="tool-mark tool-mark--kotlin" aria-hidden="true"></span><span>Kotlin</span></span>
          <span class="tool-brand"><span class="tool-mark tool-mark--android-studio" aria-hidden="true"></span><span>Android Studio</span></span>
          <span class="tool-brand"><span class="tool-mark tool-mark--gradle" aria-hidden="true"></span><span>Gradle</span></span>
          <span class="tool-brand"><span class="tool-mark tool-mark--openai" aria-hidden="true"></span><span>ChatGPT</span></span>
          <span class="tool-brand"><span class="tool-mark tool-mark--claude" aria-hidden="true"></span><span>Claude</span></span>
        </div>
      </section>
    </div>
    <a class="text-link" href={`${base}projects/`}>View my projects <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
  </div>
</Layout>
